View Details →
</div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden"> <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold p-6 bg-primary text-white"> September 6, 2024 </h3> <div class="divide-y"> <div class="p-6 transition-colors cursor-pointer bg-secondary/10 hover:bg-secondary/20" data-session="{&#34;time&#34;:&#34;9:00 - 9:30&#34;,&#34;title&#34;:&#34;Spectral Emittance of Ceramics for Solar Receivers&#34;,&#34;type&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;speaker&#34;:&#34;Elisa Sani&#34;,&#34;affiliation&#34;:&#34;INO-CNR, Florence&#34;,&#34;abstract&#34;:&#34;We describe our homemade setup for spectral thermal emissivity measurements and we summarize the experimental temperature-dependent spectral emittance of silicon carbide (SiC), tantalum diboride (TaB₂) and zirconium diboride (ZrB₂) to evaluate their potential for solar tower receivers applications.&#34;}" onclick="showSessionDetails(this)"> <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"> <div class="w-32 flex-shrink-0"> <p class="font-medium">9:00 - 9:30</p> </div> <div class="flex-grow"> <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-1">Spectral Emittance of Ceramics for Solar Receivers</h4> <p class="text-gray"> Elisa Sani (INO-CNR, Florence)
</p> </div> <div class="flex-shrink-0 text-primary">
View Details →
</div> </div> </div><div class="p-6 transition-colors cursor-pointer bg-secondary/10 hover:bg-secondary/20" data-session="{&#34;time&#34;:&#34;9:30 - 10:00&#34;,&#34;title&#34;:&#34;Photo-Thermal Properties of Coatings&#34;,&#34;type&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;speaker&#34;:&#34;Zdeněk Veselý&#34;,&#34;affiliation&#34;:&#34;University of West Bohemia, Pilsen&#34;,&#34;abstract&#34;:&#34;The contribution refers to the developed methods for the analysis of photo-thermal properties of coatings. The knowledge of these properties is important for coatings applied to energy industry, mechanical engineering and civil engineering.&#34;}" onclick="showSessionDetails(this)"> <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"> <div class="w-32 flex-shrink-0"> <p class="font-medium">9:30 - 10:00</p> </div> <div class="flex-grow"> <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-1">Photo-Thermal Properties of Coatings</h4> <p class="text-gray"> Zdeněk Veselý (University of West Bohemia, Pilsen)
